# RMG byproducts of this ticket's four reactor runs (I-234).
#
# Each of the four decks below was run to produce the numbers in report.md. What those
# numbers actually rest on IS tracked and must stay tracked: each run's ``input.py``, the
# two profiling runs' ``solver/simulation_1_3.csv``, and both captured streams for every
# run under ``logs/``. Everything named here is RMG regenerating itself -- mechanism
# exports, the seed mechanism, the restart driver, the run log, the timing spreadsheet --
# reproducible from the deck and the database at this commit, and large.
#
# Every path is written out per run directory on purpose. A bare ``chemkin/`` would work
# and would be shorter, and it would also silence that name for any run directory a LATER
# ticket adds here -- including one that meant to commit it. This file is a statement about
# these four runs and nothing else, so it names these four runs and nothing else.

prof-with/cantera2/
prof-with/chemkin/
prof-with/seed/
prof-with/RMG.log
prof-with/restart_from_seed.py
prof-with/statistics.xls

